{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55415","headline":"瀑布 · 沈彬","name":"瀑布","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"泻出岳中源化水，喷成瀑布世还希（《殷礼在斯堂丛书》本「希」作「稀」）。\n虽如仙女偷来织，不见山公采得归。\n万古色嫌明月薄，千寻勇学白云飞。\n若言真个堪裁剪，预被豪家买作衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈彬","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55415.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55415","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}